  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "Every speed here carries a label: 15 independently VERIFIED runs and 15 makers' CLAIMS."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Just out: McLaren P1, Ferrari F80 and McLaren W1, all rated at exactly 350 km/h."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "Only 3 of these 30 cars are fully electric, and two set their records in 2025."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "Not ranked yet: the Bugatti Tourbillon (445 km/h claimed) isn't in customers' hands."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "Chiron 300+ customer cars are capped at 440 km/h; the 490 run used a pre-production car."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "By Guinness rules the record is still the Tuatara's 455 km/h two-way average (2021)."
  }
 ]
